tlevania","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castlevania"}," series are very different. It is more akin to ammunition for various sub-weapons that uses a physical weapon and is sometimes separated from ",{"t":"mana and spell casting","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Magic_(game_terminology)"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}